<title>LITHUANIA: SEMA, WLMS DE BROE TO SIGN SHARE ISSUE DEAL.</title>
<headline>SEMA, WLMS DE BROE TO SIGN SHARE ISSUE DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian spirits producer Sema said on Tuesday that it planned to sign an agreement on Wednesday with Williams De Broe to distribute its new share issue.</p>
</text>
